  "description": "When the waiter smiles, doesn't it make your meal taste twice as good?\nGyobao is a chaotic power spot that will greet you like a best friend,\ndelivering excitement and happiness along with juicy boiled dumplings.\nTo that end, we make improvements and train every day based on customer feedback.\nCheck out the reviews to see what customers who have actually experienced the restaurant have to say.\n\n#1 in Google reviews in Tokyo\n#1 in TripAdvisor reviews in Japan\n#1 in 10 Best Restaurants In Tokyo\n\nGyopao is a Japanese-Taiwanese fusion restaurant in Roppongi.\nHere and only here, you can enjoy our namesake soup gyoza(dumplings/ravioli) served in chicken bone broth, which earned us the #1 spot on TripAdvisor and Google!\nOur cozy, quirky space is always filled with happy customers, and is loved not only by locals but also by guests from all over the world.\nCome have a taste of GYOPAO, our juicy, mouth-watering signature dish!",
